March 9th. The end point and starting point.

878
01:05:21,136 --> 01:05:24,636
セイヨウタンポポ。 あれから10年！？ 早いぽぽねー。
Common dandelion. 10 years since then!? That was fast, popo.

879
01:05:27,336 --> 01:05:32,336
残りの種。 10年かー。 長生きのタンポポぽねー。
Remaining seeds. 10 years, huh... A long-lived dandelion, popo.

880
01:05:34,136 --> 01:05:40,136
