Does this mean after 10 years, the child in that stroller grew up into this? Is it that kind of growth story, popo?

883
01:05:57,536 --> 01:06:01,536
てか制服高校っぽいから、ここ高校じゃった感じか？
Wait, the uniform looks like high school, so is this a high school?

884
01:06:01,936 --> 01:06:08,136
あ、トラックも来たぽぽね。 ひかないでー。 ひかないでほしいぽぽね... パリィ！
Ah, a truck is here too, popo. Don't hit it~! I hope it doesn't run over it, popo... Parry!

885
01:06:08,236 --> 01:06:12,836
パリィ！ あー... はかないぽぽー...
Parry! Ah... how fleeting, popo...

886
01:06:14,136 --> 01:06:18,936
はかないぽぽ... 誰？ お主...
How fleeting, popo... Who are you?

887
01:06:19,436 --> 01:06:22,736
JKか？ JKか？ あ！
A high school girl? A high school girl? Ah!

888
01:06:23,136 --> 01:06:28,336
飛ばしてくれるぽぽねー！ わしの命が費えても...
She's blowing the seeds for me, popo~! Even if my life comes to an end...

889
01:06:29,836 --> 01:06:35,136
わしの命が費えたとしても、お主がわしを救ってくれるぽぽか...
Even if my life ended, you're going to save me, popo...

890
01:06:38,136 --> 01:06:40,936
ありがとうぽぽー！
Thank you, popo~!

891
01:06:41,536 --> 01:06:46,336
そうしてまたタンポポは巡っていくぽぽ...
And so, the dandelion continues its cycle, popo...

892
01:06:47,336 --> 01:06:54,336
エモい感じじゃのう。 なんか途中のカオスなハゲーの時に比べて...
It feels so emotional... Compared to that chaotic bald guy section in the middle...

893
01:06:55,836 --> 01:06:59,536
いい話じゃのう...
What a nice story...

894
01:07:01,536 --> 01:07:07,836
え、これ終わり？ クレジットあるよ、お主ら。 わしもう「のじゃ」解禁ぽぽか？
Eh, is this the end? There are credits, guys! Can I finally unseal 'noja', popo?

895
01:07:09,336 --> 01:07:17,336
