Whoa... Is he drunk?!

903
01:08:02,136 --> 01:08:07,836
おい！ おい！ あり得ない音鳴ってる！ 踊ってる！
Hey! Hey! Unbelievable sounds are playing! He's dancing!

904
01:08:08,836 --> 01:08:13,136
パリィってこと！？ 踊り酔っ払いと...
Does this mean I have to parry?! A dancing drunkard...

905
